<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>The Ghost Foundation | Help the Helpers</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="The Ghost Foundation helps nonprofits, community organizations, and human-service programs strengthen programs, develop practical training, improve systems, and create measurable impact."
  >

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>

<body>

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container nav-wrapper">

      <a href="#home" class="brand">
        <span class="brand-name">The Ghost Foundation</span>
        <span class="brand-tagline">Help the Helpers.</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#workshops">Workshops</a>
        <a href="#who-we-serve">Who We Serve</a>
        <a href="#spotlight">Nonprofit Spotlight</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>

    </div>
  </header>


  <main>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section id="home" class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-content">

        <p class="eyebrow">Community Program Development • Training • Evaluation</p>

        <h1>Help the Helpers.</h1>

        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          Stronger programs. Better systems. Practical training.
          Measurable impact.
        </p>

        <p class="hero-description">
          The Ghost Foundation helps organizations that help people become
          better at helping people. We work behind the scenes to strengthen
          programs, develop practical tools and training, improve operations,
          and help organizations turn good intentions into lasting results.
        </p>

        <div class="button-group">
          <a href="#contact" class="button button-primary">
            Tell Us What Your Program Needs
          </a>

          <a href="#services" class="button button-secondary">
            Explore Our Services
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- THE CHALLENGE -->
    <section class="section section-light">
      <div class="container narrow">

        <p class="section-label">The Challenge</p>

        <h2>A strong mission needs a strong foundation.</h2>

        <p class="large-text">
          Many organizations are doing important work with limited staff,
          limited funding, and very little time to build the systems behind
          their mission.
        </p>

        <p>
          Programs may have passionate people and meaningful goals while still
          struggling with inconsistent procedures, gaps in training, unclear
          outcomes, outdated materials, or processes that simply do not work
          well in the real world.
        </p>

        <p>
          That is where The Ghost Foundation comes in.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- SERVICES -->
    <section id="services" class="section">
      <div class="container">

        <p class="section-label">What We Do</p>

        <h2>Practical support for organizations doing meaningful work.</h2>

        <div class="card-grid">

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>Program Development</h3>
            <p>
              Build new community-based programs from the ground up, including
              structure, participant processes, implementation planning,
              service delivery, and outcome goals.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>Program Improvement</h3>
            <p>
              Review existing programs, identify gaps and barriers, strengthen
              processes, and develop realistic improvements that can actually
              be implemented.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>Workshops & Training</h3>
            <p>
              Develop customized skill-building workshops, facilitator guides,
              participant materials, activities, presentations, and evaluation
              tools.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>Policies & Operations</h3>
            <p>
              Create or improve handbooks, forms, procedures, workflows,
              participant documentation, and internal systems that support
              consistency and accountability.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>Evaluation & Outcomes</h3>
            <p>
              Help organizations measure whether their programs are producing
              the intended results through surveys, assessments, KPIs, data
              review, and outcome reporting.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <h3>Research & Needs Assessment</h3>
            <p>
              Use community data, research, evidence, demographic information,
              and resource analysis to better understand needs and support
              informed program decisions.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- WHY GHOST FOUNDATION -->
    <section id="about" class="section section-purple">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="two-column">

          <div>
            <p class="section-label light-label">Why The Ghost Foundation</p>

            <h2>Good ideas should work outside of a conference room.</h2>

            <p>
              We believe program development should be informed by evidence,
              strengthened by data, and grounded in the realities of the people
              being served.
            </p>

            <p>
              Our goal is not to create impressive documents that sit on a
              shelf. We help build tools, training, and systems that staff,
              volunteers, participants, and communities can actually use.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="values-list">

            <div class="value-item">
              <h3>Practical</h3>
              <p>Solutions designed for real-world implementation.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="value-item">
              <h3>Customized</h3>
              <p>
                Built around the organization, population, and problem rather
                than a one-size-fits-all template.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="value-item">
              <h3>Evidence-Informed</h3>
              <p>
                Research, data, evaluation, and measurable outcomes are built
                into the process.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="value-item">
              <h3>Human-Centered</h3>
              <p>
                Systems matter, but the people affected by those systems matter
                more.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- WHO WE SERVE -->
    <section id="who-we-serve" class="section">
      <div class="container">

        <p class="section-label">Who We Serve</p>

        <h2>Built for organizations working directly with people and communities.</h2>

        <div class="audience-grid">

          <div class="audience-card">
            <h3>Nonprofits</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="audience-card">
            <h3>Community-Based Organizations</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="audience-card">
            <h3>Faith-Based Programs</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="audience-card">
            <h3>Human-Service Organizations</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="audience-card">
            <h3>Transitional & Supportive Programs</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="audience-card">
            <h3>Grassroots & Emerging Organizations</h3>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- WORKSHOPS -->
    <section id="workshops" class="section section-soft">
      <div class="container two-column">

        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Workshops & Training</p>

          <h2>Training that multiplies. Change that lasts.</h2>

          <p>
            The Ghost Foundation develops practical skill-development training
            for organizations, staff, volunteers, and program participants.
          </p>

          <p>
            Workshops can be completely customized or developed as reusable
            training packages that organizations can deliver again and again.
          </p>

          <a href="#contact" class="text-link">
            Ask about custom workshop development →
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">

          <h3>Workshop packages can include:</h3>

          <ul>
            <li>Facilitator guides</li>
            <li>Timed lesson plans</li>
            <li>Participant workbooks</li>
            <li>Handouts and activities</li>
            <li>Presentation materials</li>
            <li>Pre- and post-assessments</li>
            <li>Evaluation tools</li>
            <li>Material lists</li>
            <li>Customization guidance</li>
          </ul>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- NONPROFIT SPOTLIGHT -->
    <section id="spotlight" class="section spotlight-section">
      <div class="container">

        <p class="section-label">Community Impact</p>

        <h2>Nonprofit Spotlight</h2>

        <p class="spotlight-intro">
          Each week, The Ghost Foundation will highlight a nonprofit making a
          difference in its community. The goal is simple: increase visibility,
          encourage connection, and help more people discover organizations
          doing work worth knowing about.
        </p>

        <div class="spotlight-card">

          <div class="spotlight-placeholder">
            <span>Weekly Featured Nonprofit</span>
          </div>

          <div class="spotlight-content">
            <p class="small-label">THIS WEEK'S SPOTLIGHT</p>

            <h3>Coming Soon</h3>

            <p>
              Our first featured nonprofit will appear here with information
              about its mission, community, services, current needs, and ways
              people can support its work.
            </p>

            <a href="#" class="text-link">
              View the Nonprofit Spotlight →
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="spotlight-actions">

          <div class="action-card">
            <h3>Know an organization doing great work?</h3>

            <p>
              Help us discover nonprofits making a meaningful difference in
              their communities.
            </p>

            <a href="#contact" class="button button-primary">
              Nominate a Nonprofit
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="action-card">
            <h3>Want to help strengthen a nonprofit?</h3>

            <p>
              Individuals, businesses, and organizations will be able to help
              sponsor services, training, or other support for selected
              nonprofits.
            </p>

            <a href="#contact" class="button button-outline">
              Sponsor a Nonprofit
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <section id="contact" class="section final-cta">
      <div class="container narrow">

        <p class="section-label">Start a Conversation</p>

        <h2>What does your program need?</h2>

        <p class="large-text">
          You do not have to know exactly what service you need before reaching
          out. Start by telling us what your organization is trying to
          accomplish, where you are getting stuck, or what you want to improve.
        </p>

        <a
          href="mailto:contact@theghostfoundation.net"
          class="button button-primary"
        >
          Contact The Ghost Foundation
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>


  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-content">

      <div>
        <strong>The Ghost Foundation, LLC</strong>
        <p>Helping the helpers build stronger systems for lasting impact.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          © 2026 The Ghost Foundation, LLC. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
